(SECTION 2: PYTHON API ROUTING & BACKEND LOGIC (app.py)) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (5. Route Optimization Endpoint '/api/find-routes' (Lines 245-345)) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q5: How does '/api/find-routes' handle routing and what is the fallback mechanism?) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: 1) It calls OSRM driving API with 'alternatives=3' and extracts geojson coordinates, distances, and durations.) Tj T*
(     2) Scores each route using calculate_risk(). 3) If OSRM fails/timeouts, it triggers the Geometric Spline Generator) Tj T*
(     calculating 3 alternative coordinate arcs between origin and destination. 4) Selects best_route using:) Tj T*
(     'min(generated_routes, key=lambda r: r[\"score\"])', returning JSON with AI recommendation summary.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (6. Vehicle Tracking & AI Chatbot Endpoints (Lines 347-410)) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q6: How do '/api/track-vehicle' and '/api/chat' operate?) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: '/api/track-vehicle' searches the vehicles dataset by registration number (NER-MED-01, NER-OXY-09). If not found,) Tj T*
(     it generates a live simulated convoy profile to guarantee uninterrupted UX.) Tj T*
(     '/api/chat' performs semantic keyword extraction ('from...to', 'tawang', 'weather', 'track'), querying real-time backend state) Tj T*
(     and returning formatted markdown string advisories in under 20ms.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (7. Disaster Reporting & Session Controllers (Lines 412-465)) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q7: Explain the data flow in '/submit-disaster-report' and session authentication.) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: '/submit-disaster-report' parses form inputs, assigns a unique incident ID ('DIS-' + len), sets coordinates,) Tj T*
(     and prepends the incident to the incidents list so the newest hazard appears at the top. It then redirects to '/'. ) Tj T*
(     '/login' establishes cryptographically signed session cookies ('session[\"user\"]', 'session[\"role\"]').) Tj T*
(     '/' checks 'user not in session' -> redirects to login, otherwise renders index.html with live weather and incident data.) Tj T*
