(SECTION 3: HTML, CSS & JAVASCRIPT FRONTEND ANALYSIS (index.html)) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (8. Single-File Unified View Architecture (Lines 40-160)) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q8: How does index.html toggle between Login and Dashboard views in a single file?) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: Jinja2 conditional inline styles control display: '#auth-view' uses 'display: {% if is_login or not user %}flex{% else %}none{% endif %}',) Tj T*
(     while '#dashboard-view' uses 'display: {% if not is_login and user %}flex{% else %}none{% endif %}'. This eliminates multi-file) Tj T*
(     template fragmentation and allows seamless state transitions.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (9. Leaflet.js GIS Mapping & Telemetry Layers (Lines 530-620)) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q9: How are map layers, alternative polylines, and convoy animations rendered in JS?) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: 1) 'initMap()' creates the Leaflet instance centered at [26.2, 92.8] (NER centroid) and initializes 'routeLayerGroup' and) Tj T*
(     'markerLayerGroup'. 2) 'executeRouteFinder()' clears previous layers, plots Green Origin and Red Destination circle markers,) Tj T*
(     draws alternative polylines (Green weight 6 for AI Best Route, Blue weight 4 for alternatives), and calls) Tj T*
(     'map.flyToBounds(featureGroup.getBounds(), {padding: [40, 40]})' for smooth cinematic bounding.) Tj T*
(     3) 'submitVehicleTrack()' performs 'map.flyTo([v.lat, v.lon], 11, {duration: 1.5})' to focus directly on convoy coordinates.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 8.5 Tf 11 TL 0.01 0.52 0.78 rg (10. 1-Click Judge Instant Login Function (Lines 505-515)) Tj T*
/F2 8 Tf 10.5 TL 0.05 0.10 0.20 rg (Q10: How does the 'quickDemoLogin(user, role)' JavaScript function work?) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(Ans: It dynamically populates the login form fields ('login-username', 'login-password', 'login-role') with pre-authenticated demo) Tj T*
(     credentials and immediately triggers 'form.submit()', enabling hackathon judges to test any role with 1 click in under 1 second.) Tj T*
T*
/F2 11 Tf 14 TL
