(SECTION 4: RAPID VIVA SUMMARY FOR JUDGES) Tj T*
/F1 7.5 Tf 10 TL 0.15 0.20 0.30 rg
(• Frontend Tech : Leaflet.js 1.9.4, HTML5, CSS3 Variables, Asynchronous Fetch API, Glassmorphic UI.) Tj T*
